IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CACHEBLEND-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-SEQS            PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TOKENS-PER-SEQ      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 FUSED-BLOCKS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CACHEBLEND-V2.
    IF NUM-SEQS == 0 OR TOKENS-PER-SEQ == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE NUM-SEQS TO FUSED-BLOCKS.
    MULTIPLY 4 BY FUSED-BLOCKS.
    MOVE 6500 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 FUSED-BLOCKS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
